
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>RORK | Premium Streetwear Club</title>
    <style>
        /* Couleurs inspirées du logo RORK */
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #05070f;
            --bg-card: #0b0f19;
            --blue-neon: #0088ff;
            --blue-glow: #00bcff;
            --blue-dark: #002244;
            --text-light: #f3f4f6;
            --text-muted: #9ca3af;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-light);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Effet de lueur en arrière-plan */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
            background: var(--blue-neon);
            filter: blur(150px);
            opacity: 0.15;
            top: -50px;
            left: -50px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 5%;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 136, 255, 0.15);
            background: rgba(5, 7, 15, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .logo-img {
            height: 45px;
            width: auto;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 188, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .logo-text {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 136, 255, 0.5);
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 25px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover, nav a.active {
            color: var(--blue-glow);
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--blue-neon);
        }

        /* Section Héro */
        .hero {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 120px 20px 60px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: transparent;
            -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--blue-glow);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(0, 188, 255, 0.3));
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        /* Le Concept : Le Tampon Membre Signature */
        .stamp-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue-dark), #000);
            border: 2px dashed var(--blue-glow);
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 136, 255, 0.2);
            transform: rotate(-2deg);
        }

        .stamp-icon {
            font-size: 24px;
        }

        .stamp-text {
            text-align: left;
        }

        .stamp-text h4 {
            color: var(--blue-glow);
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .stamp-text p {
            font-size: 12px;
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .cta-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue-neon), var(--blue-glow));
            color: #fff;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 136, 255, 0.4);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .cta-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 25px var(--blue-glow);
        }

        /* Section Teaser Collection */
        .preview-section {
            padding: 80px 5%;
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 136, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .product-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .product-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--blue-neon);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .product-img-placeholder {
            height: 350px;
            background: #121824;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .product-info {
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .product-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .product-price {
            color: var(--blue-glow);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Petit tag sur le produit */
        .member-tag {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            background: rgba(0, 136, 255, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid var(--blue-neon);
            color: var(--blue-glow);
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            padding: 5px 10px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header / Nav -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo-container">
            <!-- Remplace "image_HoJfBS.png" par le vrai chemin de ton image si besoin -->
            <img src="image_HoJfBS.png" alt="RORK Logo" class="logo-img">
            <span class="logo-text">RORK</span>
        </div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#" class="active">Accueil</a>
            <a href="#">Produits</a>
            <a href="#">Profil</a>
            <a href="#">Communauté</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <!-- Le concept unique mis en avant par un badge style tampon -->
        <div class="stamp-badge">
            <span class="stamp-icon">🛡️</span>
            <div class="stamp-text">
                <h4>Tampon Membre Inclus</h4>
                <p>1er achat = Membre à vie. Sans frais cachés.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h1>Premium <span>Streetwear</span></h1>
        <p>Rejoins le club fermé RORK. Des pièces exclusives, une qualité lourde, conçues pour ceux qui dictent les règles.</p>
        
        <button class="cta-btn">Découvrir la collection</button>
    </section>

    <!-- Aperçu de la collection -->
    <section class="preview-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">Derniers Drops</h2>
        
        <div class="grid">
            <!-- Produit 1 -->
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="member-tag">+ Tampon Actif</div>
                <div class="product-img-placeholder">R</div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <div class="product-name">Cyber Hoodie V1</div>
                    <div class="product-price">75 USD</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Produit 2 -->
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="member-tag">+ Tampon Actif</div>
                <div class="product-img-placeholder">R</div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <div class="product-name">RORK Cargo Pants</div>
                    <div class="product-price">90 USD</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Produit 3 -->
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="member-tag">+ Tampon Actif</div>
                <div class="product-img-placeholder">R</div>
                <div class="product-info">
                    <div class="product-name">Oversized Tee Neon</div>
                    <div class="product-price">45 USD</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>

